{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Death Forest Abyss",
    "steam_appid": 3216200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Story\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a hot and humid summer day, a Japanese man was enjoying a carefree journey on his moped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The man's name was Kazuki Uchida.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He was heading to a secluded hotel deep in Fukui Prefecture, but his destination was still far away, and dusk was approaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While checking his map and drinking a can of coffee in the parking lot of a convenience store, he noticed something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It looks like I can get there without having to go around the forest if I take this route.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His map showed a narrow path through the forest that seemed like a shortcut to his destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He gulped down the coffee, gripped the handlebars of his beloved bike, and set off...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010How to Play\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to obtain four repair parts for the bike, and escape from the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures, the remains of the victims of a massacre that once took place in the forest, will chase you, but try to evade them and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, as touching them will result in instant death and a return to the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no save function in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect forgotten memories (purple square objects) scattered in the forest to view content as a bonus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Controls\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W ... Forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ... Move Left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D ... Move Right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S ... Backward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift ... Run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E ... Item List</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC ... Options Screen / Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Mouse ... Move Camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click ... Item Acquire/Use / Confirm </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(While Operating the Bike)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Mouse ... Turn Left-Right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010About Streaming\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions, so feel free to stream as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010About The Forest of Fear\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed with official approval and supervision by Kazz, the original creator of &quot;Death Forest: Escape from the Forest&quot; and &quot;DeathForest: Escape from the Forest [Proliferation].&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Finally\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those with courage, we recommend playing in a dark room with headphones on!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Story\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a hot and humid summer day, a Japanese man was enjoying a carefree journey on his moped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The man's name was Kazuki Uchida.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He was heading to a secluded hotel deep in Fukui Prefecture, but his destination was still far away, and dusk was approaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While checking his map and drinking a can of coffee in the parking lot of a convenience store, he noticed something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It looks like I can get there without having to go around the forest if I take this route.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His map showed a narrow path through the forest that seemed like a shortcut to his destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He gulped down the coffee, gripped the handlebars of his beloved bike, and set off...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010How to Play\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to obtain four repair parts for the bike, and escape from the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures, the remains of the victims of a massacre that once took place in the forest, will chase you, but try to evade them and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, as touching them will result in instant death and a return to the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no save function in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect forgotten memories (purple square objects) scattered in the forest to view content as a bonus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Controls\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W ... Forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ... Move Left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D ... Move Right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S ... Backward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift ... Run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E ... Item List</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC ... Options Screen / Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Mouse ... Move Camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click ... Item Acquire/Use / Confirm </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(While Operating the Bike)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Mouse ... Turn Left-Right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010About Streaming\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions, so feel free to stream as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010About The Forest of Fear\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed with official approval and supervision by Kazz, the original creator of &quot;Death Forest: Escape from the Forest&quot; and &quot;DeathForest: Escape from the Forest [Proliferation].&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Finally\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those with courage, we recommend playing in a dark room with headphones on!</p>",
    "short_description": "Escape from the Forest of Fear by searching for the broken bike parts while running away from the creatures that are the remains of the massacre victims!",
